{
  "_meta": {
    "source": "Marvel Splendor card list supplied by the project owner (\"Marvel Splendor Expansion Cards.csv\"), transcribed from card scans. Stone colors: yellow->mind, blue->space, orange->soul, red->reality, purple->power.",
    "ids": "c<level>-<nn>, numbered in the CSV's order within each level. Saved games refer to cards by id, so never reuse or renumber an id.",
    "timeStone": "Every level 3 card bears the Time Stone icon; the UI and engine derive it from the level.",
    "side": "Each card is a \"hero\", a \"villain\", or \"both\" for one that could go either way. It plays no part in the rules; it is what the hero and villain stats count, and a \"both\" card counts once as each.",
    "groups": "The teams a card belongs to, four at most; none is allowed. The collection page makes a row for every team that three or more cards belong to, and puts the rest under Others, so a new team appears by itself once it has three cards."
  },
